    <string name="local_network_title">Local network access</string>
    <string name="local_network_why">Your rtl_tcp server (%1$s) is on your home network, and Android asks before an app may connect to devices there.\n\nHiDef Radio uses this for one thing only: the rtl_tcp server you set. Android lists it under \"Nearby devices\".</string>
