    <!-- Build 7: the welcome card - shown at the first start, and under Settings > About -->
    <string name="welcome_title">Welcome to HiDef Radio</string>
    <string name="welcome_text">1. Plug an RTL-SDR dongle into the phone with a USB-OTG adapter, and connect an antenna.\n\n2. Tap the frequency display to type in an FM or AM station, for example 101.1 or 550.\n\n3. The arrows step through the band. The star saves a favorite.\n\n4. The sound starts in analog. On a station with HD Radio it blends to HD automatically, after about ten seconds on FM and about twenty on AM.\n\nYou can read this again under Settings > About > Getting started.</string>
