    <string name="setting_rec_help">Tap ⏺ on the main screen to start, and again to stop. Changing station or stopping the radio also ends a recording and saves it. Audio is saved as AAC (.aac), about 1 MB a minute.</string>
    <string name="setting_rec_iq_help">IQ files grow rapidly in size: about 180 MB a minute, so an IQ recording stops by itself after the limit above. IQ is saved untouched as .cu8 (8-bit I/Q, 1,488,375 samples a second), which nrsc5 plays back with -r and most SDR programs can open.</string>
